      "writtenOn": "2026-11-25T14:02:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agreed that LD_PRELOAD injection cannot demonstrate that the kernel or EEPROM driver can naturally produce these errors. \nIt only verifies how FruDevice handles simulated write() return values.\nI’ll make that limitation explicit and avoid presenting these cases as kernel-, driver-, or hardware-level validation. \nIf the goal is to verify naturally occurring failures, we need an injection point at the kernel/device boundary.",
